{"analytics_identifier":null,"base_path":"/government/news/change-of-his-majestys-ambassador-to-the-czech-republic-alastair-king-smith","content_id":"292d2051-554f-428d-8b15-9789072f5023","description":"Mr Alastair King-Smith has been appointed His Majesty’s Ambassador to the Czech Republic in succession to Mr Matthew Field OBE.","details":{"attachments":[],"body":"<div class=\"govspeak\"><p>Mr Alastair King-Smith has been appointed His Majesty’s Ambassador to the Czech Republic in succession to Mr Matthew Field OBE, who will be transferring to another Diplomatic Service appointment.  Mr King-Smith will take up his appointment in January 2027.</p>\n\n<h2 id=\"curriculum-vitae\">Curriculum Vitae</h2>\n\n<p>Full name: Alastair King-Smith</p>\n\n<table>\n  <thead>\n    <tr>\n      <th scope=\"col\">Year</th>\n      <th scope=\"col\">Role</th>\n    </tr>\n  </thead>\n  <tbody>\n    <tr>\n      <td>2026</td>\n      <td>Pre-posting training, including Czech language</td>\n    </tr>\n    <tr>\n      <td>2024 to 2025</td>\n      <td>FCDO, Deputy Director for Soft Power</td>\n    </tr>\n    <tr>\n      <td>2021 to 2024</td>\n      <td>His Majesty’s Ambassador to Albania</td>\n    </tr>\n    <tr>\n      <td>2020 to 2021</td>\n      <td>Pre-posting training, including Albanian language</td>\n    </tr>\n    <tr>\n      <td>2020</td>\n      <td>Cross-HMG Coronavirus Taskforce, Joint Head of International Engagement and Global Vaccine Summit</td>\n    </tr>\n    <tr>\n      <td>2018 to 2020</td>\n      <td>FCO, Deputy Director for Multilateral Policy and Global Co-ordinator, Media Freedom Campaign</td>\n    </tr>\n    <tr>\n      <td>2015 to 2018</td>\n      <td>FCO, Head of International Counter Extremism</td>\n    </tr>\n    <tr>\n      <td>2013 to 2015</td>\n      <td>FCO, Head of Strategic Communications and Security Campaigns</td>\n    </tr>\n    <tr>\n      <td>2013</td>\n      <td>Kenya, Acting Deputy High Commissioner, British High Commission Nairobi</td>\n    </tr>\n    <tr>\n      <td>2013</td>\n      <td>FCO, Acting Private Secretary to the Permanent Under-Secretary</td>\n    </tr>\n    <tr>\n      <td>2012</td>\n      <td>Israel, Acting Deputy Head of Mission and Head of Political Team, British Embassy Tel Aviv</td>\n    </tr>\n    <tr>\n      <td>2011 to 2012</td>\n      <td>FCO, Head of Near East Group</td>\n    </tr>\n    <tr>\n      <td>2008 to 2011</td>\n      <td>Pakistan, Deputy Political Counsellor, British High Commission Islamabad and later UK Representative for Punjab, DFID</td>\n    </tr>\n    <tr>\n      <td>2005 to 2008</td>\n      <td>UK Stabilisation Unit, Co-ordinator for Integrated Planning and Lessons Learning</td>\n    </tr>\n    <tr>\n      <td>2003 to 2004</td>\n      <td>FCO, Head of Political Planning, Iraq Policy Unit; Political Adviser to UK Special Representative and British Military Commander, Iraq</td>\n    </tr>\n    <tr>\n      <td>2001 to present</td>\n      <td>Sudan, Founding Trustee of Kids for Kids charitable foundation, helping children in Darfur</td>\n    </tr>\n    <tr>\n      <td>1999 to 2003</td>\n      <td>Sudan, Special Adviser for Peace Affairs; Head of Political, Economic and Information Sections, British Embassy Khartoum</td>\n    </tr>\n    <tr>\n      <td>1999</td>\n      <td>Libya, Acting Chargé d’Affaires, British Embassy Tripoli</td>\n    </tr>\n    <tr>\n      <td>1998 to 1999</td>\n      <td>Full-time Arabic language training</td>\n    </tr>\n    <tr>\n      <td>1996 to 1997</td>\n      <td>FCO, Desk Officer, Political Affairs, Russia Section, Eastern Department</td>\n    </tr>\n    <tr>\n      <td>1996</td>\n      <td>Joined FCO fast stream</td>\n    </tr>\n  </tbody>\n</table>\n\n<div class=\"contact contact\" id=\"contact_3939\">\n    <p class=\"govuk-body\">Media enquiries</p>\n\n\n    <div>\n        <p class=\"govuk-body govuk-!-margin-bottom-4\">\n          Email <a class=\"govuk-link\" href=\"mailto:newsdesk@fcdo.gov.uk\">newsdesk@fcdo.gov.uk</a>\n        </p>\n\n\n        <p class=\"govuk-body govuk-!-margin-bottom-4\">\n          Telephone 020 7008 3100\n        </p>\n    </div>\n\n    <p class=\"govuk-body\">Email the FCDO Newsdesk (monitored 24 hours a day) in the first instance, and we will respond as soon as possible.</p>\n\n</div>\n</div>","change_history":[{"note":"First published.","public_timestamp":"2026-07-08T12:00:02Z"}],"emphasised_organisations":["f9fcf3fe-2751-4dca-97ca-becaeceb4b26"],"images":[{"caption":"","content_type":"image/jpeg","sources":{"s216":"https://assets.publishing.service.gov.uk/media/6a4e22a192f65594cb0299d6/s216_ASK.jpg","s300":"https://assets.publishing.service.gov.uk/media/6a4e22a192f65594cb0299d7/s300_ASK.jpg","s465":"https://assets.publishing.service.gov.uk/media/6a4e22a1ed5ddb5c8626f4d8/s465_ASK.jpg","s630":"https://assets.publishing.service.gov.uk/media/6a4e22a1ed5ddb5c8626f4d7/s630_ASK.jpg","s712":"https://assets.publishing.service.gov.uk/media/6a4e22a1895317eadc354545/s712_ASK.jpg","s960":"https://assets.publishing.service.gov.uk/media/6a4e22a1024e48e52f26f4d3/s960_ASK.jpg"},"type":"lead"}],"political":true},"document_type":"press_release","first_published_at":"2026-07-08T13:00:02+01:00","links":{"available_translations":[{"api_path":"/api/content/government/news/change-of-his-majestys-ambassador-to-the-czech-republic-alastair-king-smith","api_url":"https://www.gov.uk/api/content/government/news/change-of-his-majestys-ambassador-to-the-czech-republic-alastair-king-smith","base_path":"/government/news/change-of-his-majestys-ambassador-to-the-czech-republic-alastair-king-smith","content_id":"292d2051-554f-428d-8b15-9789072f5023","document_type":"press_release","links":{},"locale":"en","public_updated_at":"2026-07-08T12:00:02Z","schema_name":"news_article","title":"Change of His Majesty's Ambassador to the Czech Republic: Alastair King-Smith","web_url":"https://www.gov.uk/government/news/change-of-his-majestys-ambassador-to-the-czech-republic-alastair-king-smith","withdrawn":false}],"emphasis